{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "5635069fed21b56b919a4eebd52ebf01feebe7bc8f6d9575ba2ffed72597921f", "ja": "テストとレッスンとアイスクリーム", "zh": "考试和练习和冰淇淋", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cd0bc6a57a6c28dc9d21c27f7df15ac5e5e1df03b916be1320fb55abbe4aca03", "ja": "飲み込みが早く、すぐにダンスのコツをつか\nむ翼。レッスン後、頑張ったごほうびとして\n翼にアイスをごちそうすることに。アイスを\n食べ終えた翼は、今度の公演にかける想いを\n口にするのだった。", "zh": "翼的理解速度很快，马上就抓到舞蹈的诀窍。\n便决定在课程结束后，请翼吃冰来犒赏她的\n努力。吃完冰之后，翼说出了自己对这次公演\n所怀抱的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2093176fe62e29f64ce26a91aa6d5fa6933599b57b5880bd72ec0d82a99d80e2", "ja": "（乙女ストーム！のレッスンがいよいよ始まった。\nみんなの調子はどうかな……）", "zh": "（『少女风暴！』的训练课程终于开始了，\n大家的状况怎么样呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "c843440faec30e1e359fb7afdc473526ebf8ef6e39dfd15e33b62e78d85311ef", "ja": "瑞希さん……。この前は、ありがと……。\n勉強会のおかげで、テスト……乗り切れました……。", "zh": "瑞希……之前谢谢你了……\n多亏了读书会……考试过关了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "da9790c3e3e6cea4e30538984d7d02d8a524b10cfe4895d83ac5d27c4a345f94", "ja": "私も、宿敵である数学のテストで、平均点が\n取れました……！　瑞希さんには感謝しかありません！", "zh": "我也在数学考试这个宿敌上拿到平均分了……！\n我对瑞希只能说感激不尽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "54b52322663c274a3eab42f837e33c6df04c6bccabf118942b4b8f277fa8d964", "ja": "それは何よりです。また何かあれば、\nいつでも頼ってください。……私はお姉さんなので。", "zh": "那真是太好了，如果还有什么事，\n随时都可以找我……因为我是姊姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "ad4219f48af0e645784bb448caa95c321439bed4845cdcfdfdbc192dfbd367f4", "ja": "それはそれとして。今日は、乙女ストーム！の\n全体レッスンの日です。頑張りましょう。おー。", "zh": "回到正题，今天是『少女风暴！』的\n团体课程日，一起加油吧，喔──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "be93a5f4f5dc19804f2179116634ff1fbad75dea283480f7183e3561d9219d6e", "ja": "ワン、ツー……。\nうん、何となく、コツつかんだかも♪", "zh": "1、2……\n嗯，总觉得好像抓到诀窍了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "835ce6137114bf197fe203ee5a2e8bf07b533324329129af2dfbc8bb2d6e8d94", "ja": "翼、スゴーい！\n今の、いい感じに踊れてたよ♪　ね、百合子！", "zh": "翼，你好厉害──！\n刚刚跳起来感觉不错耶♪对不对？百合子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "efd8dea8a6348bfbc77ed553036cccbb92972f14067d6f71ee47f8515baa2bc9", "ja": "うん。翼って、飲み込みが早いよね。\nうぅ、それに比べて私は……。", "zh": "嗯，翼总是学得很快呢。\n呜呜，相较之下我就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "7c1fe25da744137e544762ae101dbac587c16af41fd70c06bbd4b487e171ad1e", "ja": "頭ではわかってても、全然体が追いつかなくて……。\nはぁ。こんな調子で、本番大丈夫なのかな？", "zh": "就算心里知道怎么跳，身体也完全跟不上……\n唉，看这状况，正式演出真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "515324b09860f5b07d4c00a7c34bf6e3eb718e1f4120f17b06007759429a441e", "ja": "百合子。不安になる気持ちもわかるが、\nレッスンは始まったばかりだ。焦らなくていい。", "zh": "百合子，我也懂你的不安，\n但课程才刚开始，不用这么焦急。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "88f0033511486a12cf83d20f0d277a61a99d01d999593f8ca15fe0f3c9fa5cfe", "ja": "っ、{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1e0b9dbb337c26c09b991d8fae40d64a20df9cb8eee68a0363f1b98c311cb2f2", "ja": "人それぞれ、ペースがあるからな。\n百合子は百合子のペースで頑張ればいいんだ。", "zh": "毕竟每个人都有自己的步调，\n百合子，你以自己的步调努力就可以了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "f772e8a86d9feee24d966031d43fe2a435f931ebf870899509c1c974feae2143", "ja": "{$P$}さん……あなたの言葉は、\nいつも、私を勇気づけてくれますね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n你的话语总是带给我勇气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "facd4f4df141603bb17dfab448c46d9c7f26b2fa95592b104329b186c13ae6fe", "ja": "わかりました！　私、白鳥のごとく舞えるように、\nやれるだけやってみます！", "zh": "我知道了！我会尽自己所能努力，\n目标是像天鹅一般翩翩起舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e3f26adc1084dccc4564688880ca3af350c82714c27bf1176af1601f7951e3c4", "ja": "いや、白鳥はちょっと違う気がするけど……\nとにかく頑張れ、百合子！", "zh": "不，天鹅好像有点不太对……\n总之加油吧，百合子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "87471e0d8b80da7bb2800650873dc7471f2c5790b06110698ed6000c3b1748aa", "ja": "お、お疲れさまでした……。\n明日は筋肉痛になりそう……。", "zh": "辛、辛苦了……\n感觉明天会肌肉酸痛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "280d106d962dd79674552b8a3f5735015be415311dc17f059e83972690d218ca", "ja": "杏奈も……。\n簡単に、レベルアップって……できないね。", "zh": "杏奈也是……\n没办法……简简单单就升级呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7c452d67a83e37e1ee3f9b18a23ce2d9cc225de0a5f06d8d34b30b052d0667d0", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ。今日はゆっくり休んでくれ。\n気をつけて帰るんだぞ。", "zh": "各位辛苦了，今天就好好休息吧。\n回家路上要小心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "10a1485ebcb01966d39d2f9d8d15afeff0c226e9c368b044a324796b04951ed4", "ja": "ねぇねぇ、\n{$P$}さーん♪", "zh": "欸欸，\n{$P$}先生──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "512e549d34467fe2eb7b055638dc9b1c016d8a973208cf1de459e0ab73582432", "ja": "ん？　翼。まだ帰ってなかったのか。\n何か用事か？", "zh": "嗯？翼，你还没回去啊。\n有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4a28ae4a23a53bdee44aeb060c2aac4e2ee11380fe80664a473ee4640428f92b", "ja": "えへへ。今日は、{$P$}さんと\n一緒に帰ろっかなって思って。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我想说今天可以跟\n{$P$}先生一起回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "362f1f5e453a2b647eac4b73fdb0955a6bfa48b8d63c1c21d136d279516fd1d0", "ja": "話したいことあるし。それに、わたし、\n今日頑張ったから、ごほうび欲しいな～。ダメ？", "zh": "我有话想跟你说，而且我今天很努力练习，\n好想要奖励喔～不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c979d8a2d892639d3863299e65c22eeaec29f141e99e4d4c388a120e44ff493e", "ja": "確かに、翼はよく頑張ってたからな……。\nそれじゃ、駅前のアイス屋さんまで一緒に行くか？", "zh": "翼的确是非常努力呢……\n那我们就一起走到车站前的冰淇淋店吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1c8edf70308cc78b29ef379ebd35e0b48bbc285d213a9d0f78cbc8d2d5e33528", "ja": "やった！　じゃあ、さっそく行きましょ～♪", "zh": "太好了！那我们快点去吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5f6d0cfdba189a253f8d78502f3900ed662170c5701a5c3e540076cba47ad21a", "ja": "ストロベリーアイスおいしかった～♪\nおごってくれて、ありがとうございまーす♪", "zh": "草莓冰淇淋好好吃～♪\n谢谢你请客──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3e954929b4e1f6e8f94a955dc683e8f38bd8729f6762a38c9f08b0d18568a7c5", "ja": "……あれっ？　そんなにカップアイス買っちゃって、\n食べきれるんですか、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "……咦？你买那么多杯装冰淇淋吃得完吗？\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "1a6f4e162cb158ce4f0fd4613e1c93d5c269dbc245a06f12a0faf9d5ba265099", "ja": "これは俺が食べるんじゃなくて、\n乙女ストーム！への明日の差し入れ用だよ。", "zh": "这不是我要吃的，\n而是明天要给『少女风暴！』的慰劳品喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "b1f9be724c647adc177f06a4ae77c9c76a51d48d1f4b6298466c60e826ce06ae", "ja": "それはそうと……。さっき、話したいことが\nあるって言ってたけど、今度の公演のことか？", "zh": "先不说这个了……你刚刚说有话要\n跟我说，是这次公演的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "32369f211a9d03f63eee06b0f04c44b3b48930aca7c8daaa7c8fd5e24d45ee4c", "ja": "あ、やっぱ、わかっちゃいます？\nさすが、{$P$}さんって感じですね♪", "zh": "啊，你果然看得出来？\n感觉真不愧是{$P$}先生呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8b6be8dc636431bfed7cf4c0150b8851aa571d18307fff99a4e1bcffa3c2fb42", "ja": "わたし、今回の乙女ストーム！のライブ、\n結構やる気なんですよね～。", "zh": "我对这次『少女风暴！』的演唱会\n还满有干劲的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "71816428a429bb1762f3124c873cd53ec225e787a458c72f8618a130aa9903b1", "ja": "この前の、静香ちゃん達のクレシェンドブルー、\nスッゴく熱くて、負けてられないって思ったし……。", "zh": "之前小静她们『Crescendo Blue』的表演，\n气氛超级热烈的，我觉得不能输给她们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "67562e4a30060d06ec2299cc6979d1af19efb6b41ab075e6a4361e3cc7fdf6f7", "ja": "それに、今までみんなと一緒に何かをやり遂げる、\nみたいなこと、ほとんどしたことなかったから。", "zh": "而且我以前几乎没有像这样，\n和大家一起完成什么目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "e72bca5bea14b18312e68d2a0d104c1f8ef1d75a70810dae58f2ad21852993e1", "ja": "翼……。", "zh": "翼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "77639b0088f291f1f0cfbee1e12169e339c6046feca03388c984e5208aed5412", "ja": "レッスンとか大変だけど、\n未来達と一緒だから、楽しいし♪", "zh": "虽然训练课程很辛苦，\n但因为和未来她们一起，也很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7f615e0f191ee8db77638c8bdd06b51631362d269abc22551b96d2846b8d5e89", "ja": "わたしはわたしで、未来とかみんなのコト、\nサポートとかしちゃったら、カッコいいよね？", "zh": "如果我能用我的方式，\n协助未来和大家，应该会很帅气对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5ad8161619b06914ffc90b2a53fcd5700374f6ff9b894006ef1d0378f09b84e0", "ja": "それに……あのメンバーと一緒なら、\n絶対に面白いライブになるもん♪", "zh": "而且……和那些成员一起表演，\n一定会是场很有趣的演唱会嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1036_p", "source_sha256": "22ed2bc44a5e279e849d32692ab8e711fa248e1567825b6507889e7ff1c13647", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\n面白いライブになることは、間違いないと思う。", "zh": "哈哈，没错呢。\n我想演唱会一定会很有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "4d8b904d570e9c8657dc93520ab13994d38475e015c16e6dba8733391bb6b4ee", "ja": "それにしても、翼が今度の公演、そんなに\nやる気だったとはな。話を聞けて良かったよ。", "zh": "但我还真没想到，翼对这次的公演\n这么有干劲，很高兴能听你说这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e51659ffec4f2553ec17be667d19491d22bf124528df14ef7400b17d0da37cbf", "ja": "えへへ。これから毎日アイスおごってもらえたら、\nもっとやる気出るんだけどな～？", "zh": "嘿嘿，要是你接下来每天都请我吃冰，\n我应该会更有干劲喔～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "8291a053f70eeea5663e4f562951745c5268dbd58a49817ee8aa585f06788978", "ja": "さすがに、毎日は勘弁してくれ……。", "zh": "每天的话还是饶了我吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0baa0b0afe05452a8be54311521621e6dc70cc449b4ca57b2d03ad2750b66ab2", "ja": "あはは、ジョーダンで～す♪　……あ、\nそれじゃあ、わたし、帰り道こっちなんで♪", "zh": "哈哈，开玩笑的～♪\n……啊，那我要走这条路回去了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "30615692723a6efe5c1d8dd6145cb852b8b8d3005c680a485986c76314b2c5b4", "ja": "また、アイスクリームデートしましょうね、\n{$P$}さん？　バイバーイ♪", "zh": "下次再来场冰淇淋约会吧，\n{$P$}先生。拜拜～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "d99f5dc83774b2f1a5b39abbdaa91f37c0ffceb66e11cc8c703bccc3cbb31292", "ja": "デートって……。まあ、いいか。", "zh": "什么约会……不过，还是算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1043_p", "source_sha256": "120c51ca2f097732f96e68574935244d82ad4cf515e2082ad881215ca504e764", "ja": "（翼がやる気になってくれたのは、いいことだ。\n俺も気合いを入れて応えないと！）", "zh": "（翼这么有干劲是件好事，\n我也得振奋起来回应她才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "d45caa7725e3eeeb462d824a3e6a0b10932c562656e6fabdcf65d1ecd80dd6e1", "ja": "さぁ、アイスが溶けてしまう前に、\n急いで帰ろう。明日もレッスンだ！", "zh": "好了，赶紧在冰淇淋融化之前\n回家吧，明天也是训练课程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
